prayerTemplate:
You are hereby called upon to, within 15 (fifteen) days of receipt of this notice:
(a) Publish an unconditional written apology in the same medium and with the same prominence as the original publication;
(b) Issue a public retraction of the defamatory imputations;
(c) Permanently remove / take down the defamatory content;
(d) Pay damages of Rs. {damages_amount}/- towards harm to my client's reputation, mental agony, and consequential losses; and
(e) Undertake in writing not to repeat the same.

Failing the above, my client shall be constrained to {route_consequence} — including filing of a civil suit for damages and permanent injunction before the competent court, and/or a criminal complaint under Section 356 of the Bharatiya Nyaya Sanhita, 2023 — entirely at your risk, cost, and consequences.
